== Trivia ==
* This item may be a reference to an [[wikipedia:Apocryphon of John|Apocryphon]], or 'secret book'. This term is used to refer to early Christian writings that were written to teach 'secret knowledge' that wasn't allowed to be publicly taught.
* Book of Secrets was the first item voted off in a [https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/vr4l5y/book_of_secrets_is_the_first_to_go_this_is_round/ poll] to find the worst quality 0 item on [https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/ r/bindingofisaac], possibly leading to its quality increase in a later update.

